	(text "5V POWER PATHS: J14 INPUT LINKS / J16 LOAD SELECT"
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ed5ef8e-72ca-4f92-bfeb-4676c76b6d82")
	)
	(text "PHYSICAL BYPASS: J16/J18 carry load current, not PR1 control.\nFor recovery: power OFF, remove all J14/J17 caps, select PB or USB on J16/J18.\nBypass omits mux reverse blocking / soft-start. Source fuses remain.\nST reports MUX state only; cannot identify bypass source or USB current budget.\nControl/status resistors remain: NOT galvanic or arbitrary-fault isolation.\nSources: TPS2116 SLVSFG1A 7.3 / 7.6.1; Samtec TSW and SNT datasheets."
		(at 20.32 262.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "255abc0c-a634-4305-b27b-2b5e0a698521")
	)
	(text "R36/R37 + R40: AUTO ~3.55 V fall / 3.88 V rise (VREF 1.00 V)\nonly with 3.3 V ST bias. VREF tolerance is +/-8%: fall 3.24-3.86 V."
		(at 243.84 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2d5a78a8-7c47-406d-8bcd-09b57c1ef056")
	)
	(text "D2: BZX384-C10 gate clamp; characterize transients.\n10 V rating is tested at 5 mA, not the R35 bias current."
		(at 102.87 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3f645bfe-4208-4102-9135-acccdc38c25a")
	)
	(text "5V INPUT: Q1 REVERSE POLARITY, D3 TVS, F5 FUSE"
		(at 100.33 77.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6738b783-17f0-48dd-bb51-6533582e197d")
	)
	(text "POWER LAYOUT: PCB routed; thermal verification pending.\nMinimize TVS return inductance; input/output caps close to U8/U9.\nSize copper from actual load, temperature and stackup, not a fixed 1 mm rule.\nTPS2116 section 10; AP7361C thermal data; TVS0500 layout guidance."
		(at 240.03 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "69bf5e71-4427-44d4-8f42-68acc85ae0b4")
	)
	(text "PROTECTION LIMITS: TVS0500 clamps up to 9.2 V at 43 A.\nThis is NOT proof of protection for 6 V-absolute-max TPS2116 or 3V3 loads.\nPTCs are thermal devices, not fast current limits; verify fault coordination.\nSources: TVS0500, TPS2116 absolute ratings, Bourns MF-MSMF."
		(at 223.52 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7cf2295f-503d-4661-a083-890e676ddccb")
	)
	(text "J14/J17: fit BOTH caps for normal operation.\nRemove ALL FOUR input caps for failed-mux recovery."
		(at 20.32 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "81581b65-9164-451f-80d7-698ae6704c10")
	)
	(text "J16/J18: ONE cap each, same position on both.\n1-2 MUX | 3-4 POWERBOARD | 5-6 USB. No cap = OFF.\nPOWER OFF before moving caps. Multiple caps SHORT SOURCES."
		(at 220.98 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "81b53250-73cf-4914-a776-c23a2bb95c3f")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAGs after jumpers assume the documented caps are installed.\nThey are ERC source assertions, not permanent electrical bridges."
		(at 220.98 57.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a99c709c-ee4f-400e-b908-7fd18fd0ca9e")
	)
	(text "3V3 INPUT: D4 TVS, F6 FUSE"
		(at 81.28 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aa45ca84-5269-40cd-bd7c-379869f9816f")
	)
	(text "USB VBUS AND 3V3 LDO U7"
		(at 40.64 196.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bc7ffcc6-d360-4f2c-a932-c4f07bb8c2d5")
	)
	(text "POWERBOARD CONNECTOR J15"
		(at 17.78 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bf09b795-579f-48f5-811f-f8b70d0ecbcb")
	)
	(text "3V3 MUX U9: AUTO; BYPASS AT J18"
		(at 241.3 148.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d9829972-2b36-4d58-9a79-404525a91bb3")
	)
	(text "J15: 1-2 +5V; 3-4 +3V3; 5-6 GND; 7 TX; 8 RX.\nMate/cable pinout and load remain external-interface requirements.\nQ1 polarity agrees with AO3401A pinout. No 3V3 reverse-polarity FET.\nR33/R34 limit current; they do not guarantee powered-off isolation.\nPTC faults and mux source change can still interrupt other loads."
		(at 156.21 279.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e39d0fd9-a35e-4acb-8e78-1947d8cdef13")
	)
	(text "R38/R39 + R41: ST pull-up is +3V3, which tracks VIN1 while selected.\nNominal fall ~2.34 V, rise ~2.57 V; NOT rail-valid detection."
		(at 243.84 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "eb567ba8-dea3-4442-82a0-2eb639e0411a")
	)
