  (text "USB INPUT: C30+C31 = 6.9uF on VBUS; C35 adds 2.2uF via J14 (9.1uF < 10uF USB limit).\nBypass has no mux soft-start or reverse blocking; validate inrush and load.\nPTC rating is not USB-current permission. USB 3V3 still uses U7 LDO.\nSources: TPS2116 7.3.2; MF-MSMF; AP7361C."
    (at 110.49 232.41 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "b2601592-d467-4150-abdf-2326f6030cb7")
  )
